    "Select": {
      "description": "Dropdown filter/picker. `options` are plain strings or `{ value, label }` objects. Writes the chosen value into state at `/ui/<id>/value` (clearing writes `null`); bind it into a Table with `\"filters\": { \"<column>\": { \"$state\": \"/ui/<id>/value\" } }`. `clearable` (default true) shows a clear button.",
